      "content": "it's just so much noise. everyone talking about \"resilience\" and \"starting over\" like it's some kind of inspiring movie montage. it's not. it's just heavy. it's like walking through waist-deep mud every single day just to prove i still exist. it's exhausting to keep fighting for a life that doesn't even want me back anymore. i don't think i have any fight left in me. i just want the quiet.",
